The mandated preflight reached its clean-build subcheck but Lake could not detect its installation configuration in the current launcher environment. I’m treating this as an environment diagnosis, not a proof failure: I’ll inspect the pinned Lean/Lake installation and retry `check_generation` with the existing installation’s required environment intact.
